# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WildFrame — environment configuration template
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your values:
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# `server.py`, `worker.py` and `migrate.py` load `.env` automatically via
# python-dotenv. Values already exported in your shell take precedence and
# are never overridden. `.env` is gitignored — only this template is tracked.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- PostgreSQL / PostGIS -----------------------------------------------------
# Connection string for the database that holds reports, Bayesian grids,
# caches and the job queue. The default works with a Homebrew Postgres
# install (current-user socket auth, database `wildframe`).
WILDFRAME_DATABASE_URL=postgresql:///wildframe
# Remote / server Postgres, e.g.:
# WILDFRAME_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/wildframe

# --- NASA FIRMS (real satellite hotspot ingestion) ----------------------------
# Enables the "Fetch FIRMS" button and the FIRMS Live poller. Without it,
# satellite features fall back to simulation/demo only.
# Get a free key: https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/map_key/
# NASA_FIRMS_API_KEY=

# Optional alias — checked only if NASA_FIRMS_API_KEY is unset.
# FIRMS_API_KEY=

# --- Roboflow (optional AI fire/smoke photo scanning) -------------------------
# When set, uploaded photos are automatically scanned for fire/smoke.
# Free account / credits: https://app.roboflow.com/
# ROBOFLOW_API_KEY=

# --- Admin dashboard ----------------------------------------------------------
# Shared secret for the admin dashboard (/admin.html). The dashboard sends it
# as the `X-Admin-Secret` header on admin API calls. When unset, the server
# uses the development default `wildframe-admin` — CHANGE THIS IN PRODUCTION.
# WILDFRAME_ADMIN_SECRET=

# --- Government agency feeds (CAP ingest) ------------------------------------
# Shared secret for POST /api/agencies/ingest (and future agency webhooks).
# Once set, requests must send it as the `X-Agency-Key` header or get a 401;
# when unset the endpoint fails open (local dev only — do NOT leave unset on
# a public server). Can also be set at runtime via kv_store["agency_api_key"]
# (only consulted when the env var is unset — env wins). The header alone
# doesn't secure transit: put the server behind TLS once public.
# WILDFRAME_AGENCY_API_KEY=

# --- Auto-approval ------------------------------------------------------------
# Corroboration-gated auto-approval: a report with a positive AI verdict is
# auto-confirmed ONLY when an independent source corroborates it (an existing
# confirmed report within 500 m / 2 h, or a live FIRMS hotspot within 3 km /
# 12 h). Photo confidence alone never auto-approves. Set to 0 to keep every
# report in the human-review queue.
# WILDFRAME_AUTO_APPROVE=1
# Class-specific confidence floor for auto-approval (flame is noisy, smoke is precise)
# WILDFRAME_AUTO_APPROVE_FLAME_CONF=0.80
# WILDFRAME_AUTO_APPROVE_SMOKE_CONF=0.40
